OL,3,ADelhi sees more protests as freed
OL,4,A'cockroach' group's leaders vow to
OL,5,Afight on
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndia's Gen Z-led Cockroach Janta Party
OL,8,F(CJP) has vowed to continue its protest
OL,9,Fseeking the resignation of top election
OL,10,Fofficial even as the city sees more
OL,11,Fdemonstrations for a second day with
OL,12,Fthousands of security personnel
OL,13,Fdeployed and roads barricaded.
OL,15,FAbhijeet Dipke - who began the movement
OL,16,Fin May after India's Chief Justice
OL,17,Flikened some jobless young people to
OL,18,F"cockroaches" - and other leaders were
OL,19,Farrested on arrival in Delhi on
OL,20,FSaturday. They were freed on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
